=> p0 IS maxed at consec (THM-534); p1 is NOT (random cores have higher miss-one). Phi-extremality is
   IRREDUCIBLY JOINT: it does NOT reduce to p0-extremal + p1-extremal. consec wins Phi only because its
   p0-lead outweighs its p1-deficit at weight 1/3.
